# `go build .` in this directory produces a binary named after the
# directory. A 16MB compiled artifact was committed here once; keep it
# out for good.
#
# The workspace root .gitignore enumerates one such entry per app, but
# this app's line was missing and the root file is outside this app's
# tree — so the rule lives here.
/webinars

# SQLite artifacts from local runs.
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
